        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every dream has an ending.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fully remastered edition of the original <i>Dream:scape</i>, you step into the subconscious of Wilson, a man lying in a hospital bed with only minutes to live. Trapped in a surreal dream world woven from his memories, Wilson must explore the people, places, and regrets that shaped his life — before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuilt in Unreal Engine 5 with enhanced visuals, sound, and controls, <i>Dream:scape Remastered</i> preserves the award-winning narrative of the original with modern improvements for a new generation of players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the landscapes of memory</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through a quiet rural town, sunlit fields, and shadowed woods — each holding fragments of Wilson’s past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with objects and landmarks that trigger pivotal memories and reveal his story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secrets and hidden connections in a non-linear world that changes as you progress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remastered Presentation</strong> – Modern lighting, textures, and environmental detail bring the dream to life like never before.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Rich First-Person Exploration</strong> – No combat, no timers — just an immersive journey through one man’s life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Narrative</strong> – Uncover bittersweet memories, long-buried regrets, and final revelations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack</strong> – Fully re-mastered to enhance the dreamlike atmosphere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Wilson’s final dream — and find out what he’s been running from all his life.</p>",
